  "markdown": ":::warning[Private pack]\n\nThis page is of a private pack. It is not for publication.\n\n:::\n\n## Check\n\nValid. The pack's tool reports 3 finding(s), 0 gated, 3 not gated.\n\nA finding is a numbered mark on the part or link it names (filled: gated; outlined: not gated) and a row of the list of findings.\n\n## Work\n\nLayout `rows`: 6 parts, 2 links, 3 finding marks. 3 more links go to 1 hub, each hub drawn once; each such link is a badge on its caller. The switch draws the same view with every link an edge.\n\n<GraphSwitch data={page.data[\"scene-1\"]} presentation={site.presentation} />\n\n## Findings\n\n<FindingsList data={page.data[\"findings\"]} presentation={site.presentation} />\n\n## Parts\n\n| part | block | contained | fields |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `upper` | [grove](../blocks/1-soil/grove.mdx) | – | – |\n| `apple` | [tree](../blocks/1-soil/tree.mdx) | – | `grove` upper |\n| `plum` | [tree](../blocks/1-soil/tree.mdx) | – | `grove` upper |\n| `picker` | [picker](../blocks/2-hands/picker.mdx) | – | `hands` 2 |\n| `basket` | [basket](../blocks/2-hands/basket.mdx) | per `picker` | `each` picker |\n| `crop` (on the border) | [harvest](../blocks/3-yield/harvest.mdx) | – | – |\n\n## Links\n\n| from | carries | to | fields |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `picker` | `tends` | `apple` | – |\n| `picker` | `fills` | `basket` | – |\n| `basket` | `hauls_to` | `crop` | – |\n| `picker` | `hauls_to` | `crop` | – |\n| `picker` | `tends` | `crop` | – |\n\n## Border\n\nThe parts on the border of the document: `crop`.\n\n## Marked places\n\nA marked place carries `vary`: the value as written and the values a search may try there.\n\n| place | as written | a search may try |\n|---|---|---|\n| `parts.picker.hands` | 2 | 1, 2, 3 |\n\n",
